From: Ry <ry@Rys-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:20:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] RomCore: AURORA_CARD_DIR memory-card base override,
 aurora_set_host_paused() embedder pause

AURORA_CARD_DIR relocates the memory-card storage (GCI folders / raw images) so the
embedding app can keep game saves in a portable folder. aurora_set_host_paused() lets the
embedder pause the game exactly like losing window focus (clock + audio stop, no frames).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/aurora/aurora.h |  2 ++
 lib/aurora.cpp          |  1 +
 lib/dolphin/card.cpp    | 28 +++++++++++++++++-----------
 lib/window.cpp          | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 lib/window.hpp          |  1 +
 5 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

